The Editor runtime module registry contract keeps `Docs/Editor_Master_Spec`, the flat `TypeScript/Editor/*.ts` file set, `TypeScript/Editor/index.ts` re-exports, `EditorUI/editor.js`, and checks synchronized whenever runtime modules change.

WYSIWYG UI contracts include toolbar group state, slash menu keyboard navigation, suggestion selection, suggestion card, save banner, lock banner, block reorder, comment, warning, readonly, disabled, locked, and accessibility panel states.

